invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the trust check reads pin slot A and the external PSK and not
  slot B. A ticket from a handshake that the key in slot B authenticated
  is then refused while that key is in slot B alone, between steps 2 and
  3 of a rotation. test/session_ticket_tests.h's row with the
  issuer in slot B requires the hello to go out.

--- old
                    trust_names(HSPOST_TRUST_PIN, cfg->server_pubkey2, cfg->server_pubkey2_len,
                                ticket->trust_hash) |
--- new
